@startuml
title Copilot：AI 辅助查询模块（skeleton）
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "api" {
  interface CopilotService {
    +query(command, actor)
  }
  class CopilotCommand <<record>>
  class InterpretedCriteria <<record>>
  class CopilotResponse <<record>>
  class SuggestedAction <<record>>
}
package "application" {
  class MockCopilot <<skeleton mock>>
}
interface "CatalogQueryService\n(Catalog API)" as Catalog
interface "DiscoveryQueryService\n(Discovery API)" as Discovery

MockCopilot ..|> CopilotService
MockCopilot --> Catalog : 查询产品目录
MockCopilot --> Discovery : 查询真实索引结果
MockCopilot ..> CopilotResponse
CopilotResponse --> InterpretedCriteria
CopilotResponse --> SuggestedAction

note bottom
Copilot 只能调用 Catalog 和 Discovery 的 API。
它不能直接访问数据库、Redis、硬盘、下载或管理员能力。
end note
@enduml
